ees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 87.1048%; height: 104px;\" colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 87.1048%; height: 104px;\" colspan=\"7\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50.7342%; height: 104px;\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 36.3706%; height: 104px;\" colspan=\"2\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 87.1048%; text-align: center; height: 62px;\" colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 104px;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Apply Online</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 104px;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"CISF Paramedical ASI Registration 2026\" href=\"https://cisfrectt.cisf.gov.in/para_medical_staff26/para_medical_login.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 50.7342%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>How to Fill Form (Video Hindi)</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 36.3706%;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"How to Fill Form\" href=\"https://tinyurl.com/m4jpkws5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; widt